$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: (21) Representative procedure for catalyst
synthesis: (3)2-Ni(0). An amount of 82.5 mg of Ni(COD)2 (0.3 mmol) was
added in a glovebox to a mixture of 195 mg of 3 (0.6 mmol) and 68 mg of
KOtBu (0.6 mmol) in 10 mL of DMF. The mixture was stirred for 1 h at room
temperature, and used as the catalyst stock solution for catalytic
reactions. 2,6-Di-methyl-4-(phenyl)thioaniline 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): δ
7.21 (t, 2H), 7.18–7.10 (m, 5H), 2.17 (s, 6H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3):
δ 143.7 (C-Ar), 140.2 (C-Ar), 135.0 (C-Ar), 128.6 (C-Ar), 127.1 (C-Ar),
125.0 (C-Ar), 122.6 (C-Ar), 119.0 (C-Ar), 17.6 (CH3). MS (ESI): m/z 329
(M+).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
